{"path":"content/holloweensub/holloweensub_ev1010_01","commands":[{"class":"NaniSummary","line":0,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"원령들이 신성한 객잔에서 난동을?\n너희가 아직 인생의 쓴 맛을 못 봐서 그래.","en":"Aberrant Spirits running amok in a sacred inn?\nThat's because you haven't tasted the bitterness of life yet.","ja":"怨霊たちが神聖な客屋で大暴れだと？\nお前たち、まだ人生の苦味を知らないようだな。","zh-Hans":"异形灵竟敢在神圣的客栈闹事？\n我看你们是还没尝过人生的苦头。","zh-Hant":"異形靈竟敢在神聖的客棧鬧事？\n你們是還沒嚐過人生的苦頭才會這樣。","th":"พวกวิญญาณวิปริตมาอาละวาดในโรงเตี๊ยมอันศักดิ์สิทธิ์งั้นเหรอ?\nเพราะพวกแกยังไม่เคยลิ้มรสความขมขื่นของชีวิตล่ะสิ","es":"¿Espíritus aberrantes armando un alboroto en una posada sagrada?\nEso es porque aún no habéis probado la amargura de la vida."}}},{"class":"TitleCommand","line":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"PlayBgm","line":2,"fields":{"BgmPath":"bgm_story_040","Duration":"2","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Loop":"1","FadeInDuration":"0.0"}},{"class":"HideAllActors","line":3,"fields":{"Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":4,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":5,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":6,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"CharacterCloneCommand","line":7,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Origin":"ghost_specter"}},{"class":"ModifyBackground","line":8,"fields":{"Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","AppearanceAndTransition":"BG_Hwapyeongru_Restaurant","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PlaceCommand","line":9,"fields":{"Text":""},"loc":{"Text":{"ko":"화평루","en":"Harmony Pavilion","ja":"和平楼","zh-Hans":"和平楼","zh-Hant":"和平樓","th":"ศาลาสันติ","es":"Pabellón de la Armonía"}}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":10,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":16,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"59,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":17,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"76,50,12","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":18,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","TintColor":"#8993A6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"92,50,10","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":19,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":20,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":21,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.chat","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":22,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":23,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":24,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Wait":"false","Power":"1.5","Duration":"0.45","Count":"2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":25,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Wait":"false","Destination":"74,,","Duration":"0.7","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":26,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":27,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":28,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg3"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":29,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg3.question","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":30,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":31,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":32,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":33,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":34,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Hwapyeongru_Restaurant","Intensity":"0.5","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":35,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExCenterSubtitle","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":36,"fields":{"Text":"","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"원령들이 화평루를 점거한 채 소란을 피우고 있었다.","texts":{"en":"Aberrant spirits had taken over the Harmony Pavilion and were making a racket.","ja":"怨霊たちが和平楼を占拠し、騒ぎを起こしていた。","zh-Hans":"异形灵占领了和平楼，正在大吵大闹。","zh-Hant":"異形靈佔據了和平樓，正在大吵大鬧。","th":"เหล่าวิญญาณวิปริตกำลังยึดครองศาลาสันติและส่งเสียงเอะอะโวยวาย","es":"Los espíritus aberrantes habían ocupado el Pabellón de la Armonía y estaban armando un gran alboroto."}},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":37,"fields":{}},{"class":"SpawnBlur","line":38,"fields":{"Wait":"true","ActorId":"BG_Hwapyeongru_Restaurant","Intensity":"0","FadeDuration":"0.3"}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":39,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":43,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,0","Duration":"0","Wait":"false","ScenePosition":"-16,50,0","IdAndAppearance":"danhee.smile","LookDirection":"right","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":44,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"true","Destination":"22,,0","Duration":"0.65","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":45,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"하하, 소란스럽구나.","texts":{"en":"Haha, quite the commotion.","ja":"はは、騒々しいのう。","zh-Hans":"哈哈，可真热闹啊。","zh-Hant":"哈哈，真吵鬧呢。","th":"ฮ่า ๆ เอะอะกันจังเลยนะ","es":"Jaja, qué escandalosos."},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"PrintText","line":46,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"이래서는 손님들이 들어오지도 못하겠어.","texts":{"en":"At this rate, customers won't even be able to come in.","ja":"これでは客も入れまい。","zh-Hans":"这样客人们根本进不来啊。","zh-Hant":"這樣一來客人們根本進不來了呢。","th":"แบบนี้แขกก็เข้ามาไม่ได้กันพอดี","es":"A este paso los clientes ni siquiera podrán entrar."},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"PrintText","line":48,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"영업 방해네. 쫓아내야겠지?","texts":{"en":"They're disrupting business. Guess we should kick them out.","ja":"営業妨害だな。追い払うべきか？","zh-Hans":"这算妨碍营业了吧。得把它们赶走吧？","zh-Hant":"這是妨礙營業呢。得把牠們趕走吧？","th":"ก่อกวนการค้าขายนะเนี่ย ต้องไล่ออกไปสินะ?","es":"Están perjudicando el negocio. Habrá que echarlos, ¿no?"},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":50,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee.question","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":51,"fields":{"Duration":"0.2","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","LookDirection":"left","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":52,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,6","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":53,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":54,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.question","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":55,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":56,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"Wait","line":57,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.15"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":58,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,180,-4","Duration":"0.3","Wait":"true","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":59,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"흐음... 그것도 좋지만, 저 모습을 보아하니...","texts":{"en":"Hmm... We could, but look at them...","ja":"ふむ……それもよいが、あの様子を見るに……","zh-Hans":"唔嗯……那样也好，不过看它们那副样子……","zh-Hant":"嗯……那樣固然好，但看牠們那個樣子……","th":"หืม... แบบนั้นก็ดีอยู่หรอก แต่พอดูสภาพนั่นแล้ว...","es":"Mmm... Eso estaría bien, pero al verlos así..."},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":60,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee.smile","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":61,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,-4","Duration":"0.22","Wait":"true","IdAndAppearance":"hsg2","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":62,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg2"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":63,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg2.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":64,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":65,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"Wait","line":66,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.2"}},{"class":"ModifyCharacter","line":67,"fields":{"Rotation":"0,0,5","Duration":"0.25","Wait":"false","IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":68,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"hsg3","Wait":"true","Destination":"90,,10","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":69,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그저 놀고 싶은 것처럼 보이지 않느냐?","texts":{"en":"Doesn't it look like they just want to play?","ja":"単に遊びたいだけのように見えぬか？","zh-Hans":"看起来不就像只是想玩耍一番吗？","zh-Hant":"看起來不是單純想玩而已嗎？","th":"ดูเหมือนแค่อยากจะเล่นสนุกเฉย ๆ ไม่ใช่รึไง?","es":"¿no te parece que solo quieren divertirse?"},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":71,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"true","Destination":",,-8","Duration":"0.35","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":72,"fields":{"Offset":"-2,1.8","Zoom":"0.18","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":73,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"벗아, 너는 어떻게 하길 바라냐?","texts":{"en":"What do you think, my friend?","ja":"友よ、お前さんはどうしたいのじゃ？","zh-Hans":"朋友啊，你希望怎么做？","zh-Hant":"朋友啊，你希望怎麼做？","th":"สหายเอ๋ย เจ้าอยากทำอย่างไรล่ะ?","es":"Dime, camarada, ¿tú qué prefieres hacer?"},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"AddChoice","line":75,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"같이 즐긴다.","en":"Join in the fun.","ja":"一緒に楽しむ。","zh-Hans":"一同享乐。","zh-Hant":"一起同樂。","th":"ร่วมสนุกไปด้วยกัน","es":"Divertirse con ellos."}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":76,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":78,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"그럼 뭐, 원하는 대로 같이 놀아주자고.","texts":{"en":"Well, if they want to play, let's play!","ja":"ならまあ、望み通り一緒に遊んでやろうぜ。","zh-Hans":"那就依它们所愿，陪它们一起玩玩吧。","zh-Hant":"那麼，就如牠們所願，陪牠們玩玩吧。","th":"งั้นก็ เล่นด้วยกันตามที่อยากได้ละกัน","es":"Pues nada, juguemos con ellos como quieren."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":80,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee.happy","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterHopHopCommand","line":81,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"false","Power":"1","Duration":"0.35","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":82,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"danhee"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":83,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"danhee.harmony","Wait":"false","Volume":"1.0","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":84,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.3"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":85,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"auto"}},{"class":"PrintText","line":86,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"danhee","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"좋~아! 후훗, 이 몸이 제대로 노는 방법을 알려주도록 하마!","texts":{"en":"All right! Hehe... Let me show them how it's done!","ja":"よ～し！ふふっ、この我直々に、まことの遊び方を教えてやるとしよう！","zh-Hans":"好～嘞！呵呵，就由本姑娘来教教它们怎么痛快玩耍吧！","zh-Hant":"好～的！呵呵，就由本姑娘來好好教教牠們怎麼玩吧！","th":"ดี~ล่ะ! ฮุฮุ ข้าผู้นี้จะสอนวิธีเที่ยวเล่นที่ถูกต้องให้เอง!","es":"¡Bieeen! ¡Je, je, yo misma os enseñaré cómo divertirse de verdad!"},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"HidePrinter","line":90,"indent":1,"fields":{}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":91,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterMoveCommand","line":92,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"true","Destination":"28,,0","Duration":"0.55","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"HighlightCommand","line":93,"indent":1,"fields":{"ActorIds":"hsg1"}},{"class":"CharacterEmoticonCommand","line":94,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndEmoticon":"hsg1.harmony","