小的们，要去哪儿啊！？杯中的酒可还没凉呢！","zh-Hant":"嗯～？小傢伙們，要去哪裡呀！？酒杯都還沒涼透呢！","th":"หือ~? พวกเด็ก ๆ จะไปไหนกันรึ!? จอกสุรายังไม่ทันเย็นเลยนะ!","es":"¿Eeeh? Oíd, ¿a dónde vais? ¡Pero si la copa todavía no se ha enfriado!"},"author":"danhee"},{"class":"PrintText","line":153,"indent":1,"fields":{"Text":"","AuthorId":"player","RevealSpeed":"1.0","Wait":"1"},"text":"...귀신이 술독에 빠져 성불하는 건 처음보네.","texts":{"en":"...That's a first. Spirits drinking themselves into the afterlife.","ja":"……幽霊が酒樽に溺れて成仏するなんて初めて見たぞ。","zh-Hans":"……鬼魂掉进酒缸里超度成佛，我还是头一次见。","zh-Hant":"……我還是第一次見到鬼魂泡在酒罈裡超渡升天的。","th":"...เพิ่งเคยเห็นผีเมาเหล้าจนไปสู่สุคติก็คราวนี้แหละ","es":"... Es la primera vez que veo a un fantasma alcanzar la paz ahogado en alcohol."},"author":"player"},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":155,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee.embarrassed","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":156,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"true","Power":"-1","Duration":"0.45","Count":"1","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"Wait","line":157,"indent":1,"fields":{"WaitMode":"0.25"}},{"class":"ModifyCamera","line":158,"indent":1,"fields":{"Offset":"0,0","Zoom":"0","Duration":"0.4","Wait":"true","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"SetCustomVariable","line":159,"indent":1,"fields":{"Expression":"ev1010GhostResult=\"correct\""}},{"class":"AddChoice","line":161,"fields":{"ChoiceSummary":"","Lock":"0","AutoPlay":"1","ShowHandler":"1"},"loc":{"ChoiceSummary":{"ko":"혼내준다.","en":"Teach them a lesson.","ja":"懲らしめる。","zh-Hans":"教训它们一顿。","zh-Hant":"教訓牠們。","th":"สั่งสอนให้เข็ด","es":"Darles una lección."}}},{"class":"ModifyTextPrinter","line":162,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"ExDialogue","Lazy":"0","MakeDefault":"1","HideOther":"1"}},{"class":"CharacterSetAppearanceCommand","line":163,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee.serious","Wait":"false","Lazy":"0"}},{"class":"CharacterGreetingCommand","line":164,"indent":1,"fields":{"IdAndAppearance":"danhee","Wait":"false","Power"